Hi Everyone!
I hope all is fine with you
I have a question, and I would like to know if somebody can help me.

I would like to know how can I know the transition between different states (areas) in the results of BIOGEOBEARS.
I have the probabilities of each state in each node, but how can I know from where to where the "dispersion" could occurred?

Thanks!

Regards,

Natalia

From u3614237029e4b209 at groups.google.com  Mon Nov 20 16:18:11 2023
From: u3614237029e4b209 at groups.google.com (=?utf-8?q?Ivan_Magalh=C3=A3es?=)
